# Royals Kingdom Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the secrets before running the app.

NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-secret

GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/royals_kingdom?schema=public

OPENAI_API_KEY=your-openai-api-key

NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_PHONE=+971 50 000 0000
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL=hello@royalskingdom.com
ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN=replace-with-a-secure-token
